# The Great Goblin: "Whenever you put one or more counters on a Goblin, Orc, or Army you control" - counters of several kinds put on
# one permanent at once are one event (CR 603.2c). Bot1's Guide of Souls banks three energy as the Great Goblin and two Ornithopters
# enter, and when the Great Goblin attacks alone on turn 3 Bot1 pays it to put two +1/+1 counters and a flying counter on him at
# once: the ability triggers once, for 2 damage, and the 5/4 Great Goblin deals 5 unblocked. Bot2 is at 13.

